<article id="post-85" class="post-85 page type-page status-publish hentry intro">
	<header class="entry-header">
		<h2 class="entry-title">Contact Us</h2>
	</header><!-- .entry-header -->

	<div class="entry-content">
		<h1>Contact Us</h1>
<p>There many ways to contact ROBLOX!</p>
<p>If you are interested in a career at ROBLOX, please email us at <a href="mailto:jobs@roblox.com?subject=Job%20inquiry%20from%20the%20ROBLOX%20Contact%20Us%20page">jobs@roblox.com</a>.</p>
<p>If you are a member of the press, please contact us at <a href="mailto:press@roblox.com?subject=Press%20inquiry%20from%20corp.roblox.com">press@roblox.com</a>.</p>
<p>If you have a question or need help with a customer service issue, please email us at <a href="mailto:info@roblox.com?subject=inquiry%20from%20the%20ROBLOX%20Contact%20Us%20page">info@roblox.com</a> and we will respond as soon as possible!</p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<h1>Connect with ROBLOX</h1>
<p>You can also connect with ROBLOX through a number of different online channels!</p>
<p>Get the latest scoop on ROBLOX on our <a href="http://blog.roblox.com">Community Blog</a>.</p>
<p>Become a fan of <a href="http://www.facebook.com/ROBLOX">ROBLOX on Facebook</a>.</p>
<p>Subscribe to the <a href="http://www.youtube.com/ROBLOX">ROBLOX channel on YouTube</a>.</p>
<p>Vote for new features or submit your own ideas on our <a href="http://roblox.uservoice.com">Feature Forum</a>.</p>
<p>On Twitter, you&#39;ll find a lot of ROBLOX action: <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/ROBLOX">@ROBLOX</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/InfoAtROBLOX">@InfoAtROBLOX</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/BuildermanHQ">@BuildermanHQ</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/Shedletsky">@shedletsky</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/BrighteyesRBLX">@BrighteyesRBLX</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/ReeseMcBlox">@ReeseMcBlox</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/erikcassel_RBLX">@erikcassel_RBLX</a>, <a href="http://twitter.com/#!/mattdusekwho">@mattdusekwho</a>, and many more.</p>
					</div><!-- .entry-content -->
</article><!-- #post-85 -->

				
